==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns as the boss after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As in most [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] stages, [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] is useful as a meatshield. If you have [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]], use him and you will be fine. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] is also recommended for dealing heavy damage to the enemies.

